  2371	        # L2/L3. A commit rewriting it to `true` is ordinary L1 source by path,
  2372	        # so it earned SAFE TO MERGE with no meaningful tests and no review.
  2373	        # Classifying the config FILE would be too blunt — it is in the first
  2374	        # span of every repo after `init`, and a floor that fires on adoption
  2375	        # is a floor people route around. The CHANGE is what needs the review.
  2376	        with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as d:
  2377	            run = self._repo(d, cmds={})          # no reviewer configured
  2378	            self._cl(d, "attest", "--tests")      # evidence, so a baseline exists
