   187	### 🎚️ The tier isn't yours to declare — `coverloop classify`
   188	
   189	Every gate above keys off the **risk tier**. So if the tier is just *declared*, one mislabel — a typo, a hurry, an optimistic agent — silently skips the whole L3 chain. No alarm. No evidence that anything was skipped. **That is the one place this design could be defeated for free**, so the tier is now *derived*:
